    "text": "<p>A reversible cyclic process for an ideal gas is shown below. Here, <math><mi>P</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi> </mi><mi>T</mi></math> are pressure, volume and temperature, respectively. The thermodynamic parameters <math><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>w</mi><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>H</mi><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi> </mi><mi>U</mi></math> are heat, work, enthalpy and internal energy, respectively.<br ><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/2fcdab9c-3af5-47c3-a08f-eca603449393-image.png\"/><br >The correct option(s) is (are)</p>",
